font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、按市公司结算价50%</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >：五年累计亏损</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >181.43万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，仅</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2025年在业务量大幅上升后勉强持平（+0.69万元）。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >3、按市公司结算价70%</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >：五年累计亏损</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >108.81万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2025年盈利42.33万元，但前四年亏损仍无法弥补。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
