mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >4、按市场价（FTU 1000元/台、DTU 1400元/台）</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >：五年累计仍亏损</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >23.49万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，为四种口径中最优，</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2025年可盈利91.43万元。说明即便完全按市场价结算，2021—2024年间因业务量小、固定成本高，仍难以盈利，仅在业务量达到2025年规模（FTU千台以上）后方可实现较好收益。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=24  style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >总体结论：无论何种结算口径，本业务五年整体均为亏损，只有市场价口径且业务量足够大时才具备盈利能力。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;tab-stops:left blank 0.0000pt ;
