mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;font-size:15.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >二、</span></span><![endif]><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >调试业务直接交由施工单位承担的优势分析</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h2 style="margin-right:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2021年以前，配电终端调试即由施工单位在安装的同时直接完成，该模式具有以下优势：</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;tab-stops:left blank 0.0000pt ;
text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >（一）</span></span><![endif]><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >时间进度优势</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><h3 style="margin-right:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:3;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:normal;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、安装与调试由同一主体一次完成，</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >“装完即调、调完即验”</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:normal;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，无需等待另一单位到场，消除了安装与调试之间的交接、等待环节；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:normal;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、避免了因停电计划变更、现场信号、厂家配合等原因造成的二次进场，终端投运周期明显缩短；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >3、减少了重复往返现场的车辆与时间消耗。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >（二）工作计划优势</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、施工单位对本标段的工程进度、停电计划最为清楚，可将调试直接纳入施工计划</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >统一排产、统一调度</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、无需在配网部、信通、配电指挥中心、多家甲方单位与十余家施工单位之间反复协调调试窗口，计划协同链条大幅简化；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >3、计划变更时施工单位可内部即时调整，响应速度快。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >（三）劳动合同（用工）纠纷优势</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、调试人员即施工单位自有人员，</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >劳动关系归属清晰</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，工资、工伤、加班等责任主体明确；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、避免了跨单位借用人员、协作队伍混合作业带来的用工边界不清问题，从源头上杜绝劳动合同纠纷及连带责任风险。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >三、调试业务交由盐开电气分公司承担的缺陷分析</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >（一）与施工单位及上游主业沟通协调成本高</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、盐开分公司作为中间环节，需长期对接</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >配网部、信通、供电服务指挥中心等多个上游部门，华源、海翔、设计院</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >3家甲方单位、4个业主单位（亭湖、开发区、盐都、三新）以及10多家下游施工单位</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，管理半径大、沟通链条长；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、调试计划完全受制于施工进度和停电计划，施工单位计划变更、设备未安装到位、现场条件不具备等情况均需分公司被动协调，协调不畅时人员到场却无法作业，形成窝工。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >（二）重复调试问题突出</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、由于安装与调试分离，施工单位安装完成后分公司须另行进场调试；遇安装质量问题、设备缺陷、通信信号问题时须多次往返处理，据统计</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >实际调试量比计划增加约</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >25%，单台工作量增加约20%</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、另有</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >约</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >10%的终端在调试完成后因工程变更被取消</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，此部分工作量未获计价，形成重复劳动和无效投入。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >（三）人工及配套成本大幅增加</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:13.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、为承接该业务，调试队伍由最初</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1组2人扩充至5组</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，车辆、调试设备、</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >UKEY等配套同步扩容；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、2021—2025年公司自有支出累计</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >194.64万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，协作支出累计</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >185.67万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，合计</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >380.31万元</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >，且逐年攀升（</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2024、2025年均超过100万元/年）；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >3、上述固定人工成本在业务量不足年份无法摊薄，是造成各口径长期亏损的根本原因。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >四、综合建议</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >1、若继续由分公司承接，应推动上游按</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >不低于市公司结算价</font><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >70%、争取市场价</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >口径结算，并对重复调试、调后取消部分单独计价；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
mso-para-margin-right:0.0000gd;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;
mso-pagination:widow-orphan;line-height:150%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >2、从全链条效率与成本看，可研究</font></span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >调试业务回归施工单位一体化实施</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="方正仿宋_GB2312" >的可行性，分公司转为技术监督、验收把关角色，以降低协调成本、消除重复调试、控制用工风险。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;line-height:150%;
color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>